"Inline boxes: shortcode %1$s or the \"GRS Pop inline\" block. Link that "
"opens a popup anywhere: %2$s."
msgstr ""
"Box nel contenuto: shortcode %1$s o blocco \"GRS Pop inline\". Link che apre"
" un popup in qualsiasi punto: %2$s."

#: includes/admin/class-admin.php:635 includes/class-renderer.php:178
#: assets/js/builder.js:1 assets/js/builder.js:3
